  "solution": {
    "text": "Tangents drawn from external points are of equal length.\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad B D=B E=a-r$\r\n$[\\because C D=r]$\r\nand $\\quad A F=A E=b-r$\r\n$[\\because C F=r]$\r\n$A E+B E=A B$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad b-r+a-r=2 R$\r\n$1 \\because A B$ is a diameter of circumcircle]\r\n$\\Leftrightarrow \\quad b+a=2 R+2 r$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad 2(r+R)=a+b$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/5tderuuou8yjhmjmnk.png\">",
